# This repository commits its generated output on purpose. Every README, every
# file under prompts/, llms.txt and metadata/about.txt is emitted by
# scripts/build.mjs and reviewed in the pull request that changes it, so there
# is nothing to hide from git here and this file stays deliberately short.
#
# Nothing the build reads or writes may ever be listed below. scripts/verify.mjs
# fails the build if a script or the data file appears in this file: the two
# repositories this one learned from each keep their generator out of the tree,
# and both stopped moving when the one person holding it did.

node_modules/
.DS_Store
